    "translations": {
      "diagram.description.lifecycle": "Three rungs, left to right: nobody has checked this yet; checked by automation only; confirmed by a person, once a person's confirmation appends a human: event. A person can confirm from either lower rung. An edit after the confirmation drops the rung until a person confirms again. A question reopens the concept, and the rung stays."
    },
